#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A free IBM course on utility-scale quantum computing featuring realistic use"
" cases and best practices"
msgstr ""
"Isang libreng kurso ng IBM sa utility-scale quantum computing na may mga "
"makatotohanang use case at pinakamahusay na mga gawi"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-computing-in-"
"practice/hero.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course focuses on today's quantum computers and how to use them to "
"their full potential. It covers realistic potential use cases for quantum "
"computing as well as best practices for running and experimenting with "
"quantum processors having 100 or more qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay nakatuon sa mga quantum computer ngayon at kung paano "
"gamitin ang mga ito nang buong husay. Sinasaklaw nito ang mga makatotohanang"
" potensyal na use case para sa quantum computing pati na rin ang "
"pinakamahusay na mga gawi sa pagpapatakbo at pag-eeksperimento sa mga "
"quantum processor na may 100 o higit pang qubits.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Inirerekomendang background {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To make the most out of this course, we recommend a familiarity with quantum"
" information and quantum circuits, at the level explained in the [Basics of "
"quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information) "
"course.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para masulit ang kursong ito, inirerekomenda naming may kaalaman ka sa "
"quantum information at quantum circuit, sa antas na ipinaliwanag sa kursong "
"[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-"
"information).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Other recommended references include the following:\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa iba pang inirerekomendang sanggunian ang mga sumusunod:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Chris Bernhardt. [Quantum Computing for "
"Everyone.](https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262539531/quantum-computing-for-"
"everyone/)\n"
msgstr ""
"Chris Bernhardt. [Quantum Computing for "
"Everyone.](https://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262539531/quantum-computing-for-"
"everyone/)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Thomas Wong. [Introduction to Classical and Quantum "
